; qwen38-heed-cursor-run.fk — the LIVE witness: real Qwen weights, real forward
; passes, real tokenizer bytes streaming through the heed cursor.
;
; The prompt shows the model the envelope and asks it to use it, so the cursor's
; scan meets a genuine decoded stream rather than a scripted one. The lookup is
; fcmg-heed-lookup-nothing — this checkout holds no knowledge substrate, so
; every complete envelope answers a typed `nothing` with reason
; no-knowledge-substrate. That is the honest live floor: the CARRY is witnessed
; end to end; the ANSWER waits on an adapter.
;
; No logit executes anything. q38-forward returns an argmax over a distribution;
; the cursor recognizes bytes; the carrier decides. model-executed reads 0.
;
; Effectful: opens a sealed 29GB GGUF and drives the GPU. Do not preflight.
; preludes: form/form-stdlib/form-cli-model-generate.fk

